      },
      "publicNotes": "<h2>Appearance</h2>\n<p>A dragon made of living wood and root: bark scales, a mane of leaves turning autumn gold and red, eyes like knots of amber sap. Mushrooms and moss grow in the cracks of its hide. Its jaws hang open to show teeth of polished root, and soil spills from its mouth.</p>",
      "privateNotes": "<p><strong>@UUID[Compendium.points-of-interest.journals.JournalEntry.jxn9bB1XhZTRpF65.JournalEntryPage.d5zY0mPkcFChKYhl]{16. The Trickster's Emissary}.</strong> The herald's mount. Entombing Breath on clusters, Swallow Whole on the strongest melee PC.</p>"
    },
